/*
 * BuildingFootprints.cs - The ground area a building covers
 *
 * The footprints come from the blocked cells of the settlers-remake
 * (MIT) building XMLs. The ground under a building's footprint is
 * replaced by sand when the building is placed (like the original game,
 * where buildings stand on a flattened sand foundation).
 *
 * freeserf3.net is free software: you can redistribute it and/or modify
 * it under the terms of the GNU General Public License as published by
 * the Free Software Foundation, either version 3 of the License, or
 * (at your option) any later version.
 */

